ubmitted, as defined in their mission statements. Frontiers reserves the right to guide 17 an out-of-scope manuscript to a more suitable section or journal at any stage of peer review. 18 Fonte: <http://journal.frontiersin.org/researchtopic/1563/augmentation-of-brain-function-facts-fiction-and-controversy>. Acesso em: 15 jul. 2017
